==Serbo-Croatian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{qualifier|Ijekavian}}: {{l|sh|pjȅsma}}

===Etymology===
From earlier *{{m|sh||pěsma}}, by assimilation p-n > p-m from {{etyl|sla-pro|sh}} {{m|sla-pro|*pěsnь}}. The original stem has been preserved in archaic {{m|sh|pjȅsan}} as well as old derivations such as {{m|sh|pjȅsnīk}}/{{m|sh|pȅsnīk}}.

